*** Integer Partitions (Coin Change Pattern)


Time: O(N²) Space: O(N)
Calculate dp[i] = Number of ways to form sum i.
// Count Ways:
 Order Doesn't Matter
//      for(piece)
//          for(sum)
 Order Matters
//      for(sum)
//          for(piece)

code:-

dp[0] = 1
 for(piece = 1 -> N)
     for(sum = piece -> N)
         dp[sum] += dp[sum-piece];
